{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/185800e632991e40248ee6c9d2ddba35.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Burn is our love letter to the early \u201990s cute-em-up classics like\u00a0Parodius\u00a0and\u00a0Pop\u2019n TwinBee\u00a0\u2014 games that were bold, wildly creative, and completely, delightfully bonkers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute-\u2019em-up is a playful twist on the classic shoot-\u2019em-up genre, blending fast-paced arcade action with adorably chaotic characters and worlds. Expect all the dodging, blasting, and bullet-hell intensity you love\u2014wrapped in bright, charming, and often hilarious visuals.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0Astro Burn, you play as\u00a0Astro\u00a0\u2014 a daredevil feline astronaut strapped into a high-powered jetpack \u2014 and her trusty robot sidekick\u00a0AL\u00a0as they return from a deep-space mission to discover Earth has been overtaken by\u00a0colossal, cute-but-chaotic overlord animals\u2026 and not a single human in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with outrageous weapon combos, a rocket-fuelled jetpack, and purrfectly tuned reflexes, you\u2019ll blast through\u00a0absurd bullet-hell swarms, dodge rainbow-coloured laser storms, and face off against\u00a0giant cosmic creatures\u00a0who rule the galaxy with an aggressively adorable iron paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect\u00a0screen-filling mecha pandas,\u00a0hyperactive huskies wagging up solar vortexes,\u00a0opera-singing space squids, and\u00a0celestial goldfish launching star-shaped projectiles\u00a0\u2014 all delivered with the wonderfully unhinged, anything-goes spirit of the 90s arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0cute-em-up chaos\u00a0dialled to MAX \u2014 a nostalgic side-scrolling shooter inspired by 16-bit arcade madness, reborn with modern pixel art, tight controls, and over-the-top personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s retro mayhem with a cosmic wink: giant animal bosses, unhinged bullet patterns, cosmic comedy, and jetpack-fuelled heroics all wrapped into one delightfully chaotic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nostalgic side-scrolling <strong>Cute -\u2019em-up</strong> inspired by 16-bit classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn with slick modern pixel art, tight controls, and <strong>adrenaline-pumping action</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 lives cat health system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Co-Op Arcade modes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each level as you progress, with the freedom to replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging end of level bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack-em up weapon system:\u00a0 Collect as many weapons and fire them all at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 10 diverse levels\u2014from deep space and mechanical worlds to Earth\u2019s skies, underwater realms, sprawling cities, and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 3\u20135 hours of action-packed gameplay, with even more hours to sink in through skill mastery and level replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Score leaderboard with Time (hello speed-runs!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catnip Power-up\u00a0 (Bullet time in space!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome synth-wave retro cool soundtrack by Venice Bleach, with a dash of meow-ness layered in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a8724721928b9b16b986e424fd158364.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the chaos \u2014 team up in co-op mode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share weapons and work together to take down the evil machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive co-op, Space cat with the highest score is the winner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Leaderboard (with classic 3 letter initials with your score and fastest time)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboard via Discord, to share with your friends, community of Astro Burner's and join discord tournaments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810660?t=1767716822","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/d92932c84f1fc8b5172b19f859bb56dec4e7402d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767716822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/32f1ab8754221af4af4366af205b64f705d6ead7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767716822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/32f1ab8754221af4af4366af205b64f705d6ead7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767716822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4048530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/185800e632991e40248ee6c9d2ddba35.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Burn is our love letter to the early \u201990s cute-em-up classics like\u00a0Parodius\u00a0and\u00a0Pop\u2019n TwinBee\u00a0\u2014 games that were bold, wildly creative, and completely, delightfully bonkers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f96b59bc220c2593e808409a236b169b.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/842b11f9e32f44eed6a9e1d5e6c45a6a.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.webp?t=1767716822\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/35b93111ab5e9c1080cfb97e1e471971.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=153 height=95 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute-\u2019em-up is a playful twist on the classic shoot-\u2019em-up genre, blending fast-paced arcade action with adorably chaotic characters and worlds. Expect all the dodging, blasting, and bullet-hell intensity you love\u2014wrapped in bright, charming, and often hilarious visuals.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/99492283aac05cf81c20a05d11a49415.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0Astro Burn, you play as\u00a0Astro\u00a0\u2014 a daredevil feline astronaut strapped into a high-powered jetpack \u2014 and her trusty robot sidekick\u00a0AL\u00a0as they return from a deep-space mission to discover Earth has been overtaken by\u00a0colossal, cute-but-chaotic overlord animals\u2026 and not a single human in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/0702a75fbc31c7f257b9c633f7127166.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with outrageous weapon combos, a rocket-fuelled jetpack, and purrfectly tuned reflexes, you\u2019ll blast through\u00a0absurd bullet-hell swarms, dodge rainbow-coloured laser storms, and face off against\u00a0giant cosmic creatures\u00a0who rule the galaxy with an aggressively adorable iron paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/4f9dc5648f4f5c58f6aa556a64cc51c1.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect\u00a0screen-filling mecha pandas,\u00a0hyperactive huskies wagging up solar vortexes,\u00a0opera-singing space squids, and\u00a0celestial goldfish launching star-shaped projectiles\u00a0\u2014 all delivered with the wonderfully unhinged, anything-goes spirit of the 90s arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/54661ba16132b0e322ca0c0c811d5f5c.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0cute-em-up chaos\u00a0dialled to MAX \u2014 a nostalgic side-scrolling shooter inspired by 16-bit arcade madness, reborn with modern pixel art, tight controls, and over-the-top personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.poster.avif?t=1767716822\" width=548 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.webm?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/622cd211cd6cfc54018beaab9db38843.mp4?t=1767716822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s retro mayhem with a cosmic wink: giant animal bosses, unhinged bullet patterns, cosmic comedy, and jetpack-fuelled heroics all wrapped into one delightfully chaotic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nostalgic side-scrolling <strong>Cute -\u2019em-up</strong> inspired by 16-bit classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn with slick modern pixel art, tight controls, and <strong>adrenaline-pumping action</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 lives cat health system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Co-Op Arcade modes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each level as you progress, with the freedom to replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging end of level bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack-em up weapon system:\u00a0 Collect as many weapons and fire them all at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 10 diverse levels\u2014from deep space and mechanical worlds to Earth\u2019s skies, underwater realms, sprawling cities, and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 3\u20135 hours of action-packed gameplay, with even more hours to sink in through skill mastery and level replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Score leaderboard with Time (hello speed-runs!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catnip Power-up\u00a0 (Bullet time in space!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome synth-wave retro cool soundtrack by Venice Bleach, with a dash of meow-ness layered in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/a8724721928b9b16b986e424fd158364.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the chaos \u2014 team up in co-op mode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share weapons and work together to take down the evil machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive co-op, Space cat with the highest score is the winner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1767716822\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Leaderboard (with classic 3 letter initials with your score and fastest time)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboard via Discord, to share with your friends, community of Astro Burner's and join discord tournaments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Beyond The PIxels"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/b02be8ba22b25765fd8c50bc0329d18284a290f7/header.jpg?t=1767716822","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Astro Burn is an original IP created and owned by Beyond The Pixels \u00ae Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/172559617/b299b6f06d4f0dc2546fff81c794f7e6633607a8/1767713339/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767716820","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/172559617/b299b6f06d4f0dc2546fff81c794f7e6633607a8/1767713339/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767716820","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810660/172559617/b299b6f06d4f0dc2546fff81c794f7e6633607a8/1767713339/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767716820","id":257175796,"name":"Announcement Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175796/69088dbe877839ed37b7f105cf12ff2aafb3e122/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767716820"}],"name":"Astro Burn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphi