:"A fast-paced sci-fi cute-em-up filled with colourful bullet-hell chaos and giant adorable animals in huge mechs. Play as Astro a space cat, as you blast, dodge, upgrade, trigger Catnip Mode, and take down screen-filling cute critters overload in retro arcade style.","steam_appid":3810660,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.beyond-the-pixels.com/contact-8"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.beyond-the-pixels.com"}